Coats your stone spikes with insidious poison, dealing [121, 163, 195, 223, 247 (TL1-5; PP 100; SP 100)] total nature damage over 6 turns while reducing all healing by [51%, 57%, 61%, 64%, 66% (TL1-5; PP 100; SP 100)].

The damage increases with Spellpower and the chance to poison and healing reduction increases with either Spellpower or Physical Power, whichever is greater.
